00:24:13.849 --> 00:24:15.849
Well, that makes sense.

00:24:15.849 --> 00:24:19.849
They charge big money for every drop, and then the city is at their mercy.

00:24:19.849 --> 00:24:21.849
Scan complete.

00:24:21.849 --> 00:24:23.849
Anomily detected.

00:24:23.849 --> 00:24:31.390
Is that who I think it is?

00:24:31.390 --> 00:24:33.390
Winslow's shot.

00:24:33.390 --> 00:24:35.390
Toyman.

00:24:35.390 --> 00:24:39.390
When in doubt, I say, go straight to the source.

00:24:39.390 --> 00:24:55.400
Be naughty.

