00:26:39.880 --> 00:26:47.569
She was willing to sacrifice everything for her bulletproof bow.

00:26:47.569 --> 00:27:02.150
The tragic tale of one, Lana Lang, and Clark Kent.

00:27:02.150 --> 00:27:13.049
I don't know what's in the water you've been drinking.

00:27:13.049 --> 00:27:20.839
But you are lost at sea if you think Clark Kent is connected to the blur.

00:27:20.839 --> 00:27:25.660
You've got quite the poker face, Miss Lane.

00:27:25.660 --> 00:27:30.000
