00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:37.549
Because at this very moment, my team of villains,

00:27:37.549 --> 00:27:40.549
my team of villains are closing in on the blur.

00:27:40.549 --> 00:27:49.910
What a shame it would be for the blushing bride

00:27:49.910 --> 00:27:57.720
to be wearing a black veil on her special day.

00:27:57.720 --> 00:27:58.720
Unless?

00:27:58.720 --> 00:28:10.920
