Members of Marionette Enterprises, I bid you.

00:31:52.799 --> 00:31:54.799
Hello.

00:31:54.799 --> 00:31:58.799
If you'd be so kind as to pass your mission folders to one another,

00:31:58.799 --> 00:32:01.799
