00:32:01.799 --> 00:32:07.559
Now, I know it might feel like cheating to know what cards the other side is holding,

00:32:07.559 --> 00:32:09.559
but we can ill afford to lose.

00:32:09.559 --> 00:32:10.559
Not now.

00:32:10.559 --> 00:32:14.559
Not when we are this close to bringing Metropolis to its knees and getting what we deserve.

00:32:14.559 --> 00:32:19.210
And with the help of our newest associate,

00:32:19.210 --> 00:32:24.210
associate will finally take control of the metropolis aquifer.

00:32:24.210 --> 00:32:28.210
We will bleed their pockets dry until the parched populace

00:32:28.210 --> 00:32:31.210
is dancing for us like puppets on a string.

00:32:31.210 --> 00:32:34.210
In fact, she's taking care of the floor right now.

00:32:34.210 --> 00:32:38.210
We are going to have so much!

00:32:38.210 --> 00:32:44.130
Ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha ha.

00:32:44.130 --> 00:32:52.759
Thanks, Courtney.

00:32:52.759 --> 00:32:54.759
Stargirl's got us on the next ferry to strikers.

00:32:54.759 --> 00:32:57.759
Good. I'll bring the truck around. Lois has been in there too long without checking in.

00:32:57.759 --> 00:32:59.759
How are you coming on disrupting those diodes?

00:32:59.759 --> 00:33:00.759
Almost there.

00:33:00.759 --> 00:33:10.400
Toyman put a diode on her neck.

00:33:10.400 --> 00:33:11.400
How long until sunset?

00:33:11.400 --> 00:33:21.559
You need to stall her.

00:33:21.559 --> 00:33:23.559
The sun's almost down.

