Hold on, Clark, just a little bit longer.

00:33:32.880 --> 00:33:33.880
20 seconds.

00:33:33.880 --> 00:33:36.880
You're the most stubborn iron-willed woman I've ever met.

00:33:36.880 --> 00:33:38.880
Don't let him win.

