Answer me.

00:34:31.480 --> 00:34:32.480
Lois, wake up.

00:34:32.480 --> 00:34:33.480
It's okay.

00:34:33.480 --> 00:34:48.840
Oh no, you can rest assured the blur won't be a problem.

