00:34:55.389 --> 00:34:57.389
Back so soon, my pretty little play thing?

00:34:57.389 --> 00:34:59.389
I'm flattered, Winslow.

00:34:59.389 --> 00:35:01.389
Playtime's over.

00:35:01.389 --> 00:35:15.760
What's to say I just don't tell the whole world who you really are?

00:35:15.760 --> 00:35:19.760
Something tells me if you really wanted to you already would have.

00:35:19.760 --> 00:35:22.760
But then, we wouldn't be able to play anymore, wouldn't we?

00:35:22.760 --> 00:35:23.760
to play anymore, would we?

00:35:23.760 --> 00:35:28.619
No matter how many of you band together?

00:35:28.619 --> 00:35:30.619
What games you decide to play?

00:35:30.619 --> 00:35:50.610
I'll always be there to stop you.

00:35:50.610 --> 00:35:53.610
I trust you found my gift to the both of you

00:35:53.610 --> 00:35:55.610
