00:38:49.960 --> 00:38:55.449
I just never realized how strong it was.

00:38:55.449 --> 00:39:36.940
I was so weak, Clark.

00:39:36.940 --> 00:39:38.940
You know, the very moment that Toryman threatened you,

00:39:38.940 --> 00:39:42.940
I put on that diode and I let him control me.

00:39:42.940 --> 00:39:51.539
Because you are my greatest weakness.

00:39:51.539 --> 00:39:54.539
And I'm afraid that I will be yours.

00:39:54.539 --> 00:39:56.539
You're not my weakness.

00:39:56.539 --> 00:39:58.539
You're my strength.

00:39:58.539 --> 00:39:59.539
Okay?

00:39:59.539 --> 00:40:02.539
And I'm sorry that Jurel dragged you into one of my trials,

00:40:02.539 --> 00:40:03.539
