After today, I realized that as being together

00:40:37.659 --> 00:40:41.420
makes you vulnerable.

00:40:41.420 --> 00:40:42.420
And I...

00:40:42.420 --> 00:40:47.420
I can't just sit and watch a movie and eat ice cream.

00:40:47.420 --> 00:40:51.420
When at that very moment you could be saving five people.

00:40:51.420 --> 00:40:57.889
Clark, every moment of your life that I take for myself,

00:40:57.889 --> 00:40:58.889
I am saying.

00:40:58.889 --> 00:41:00.889
Stealing from people who need saving.

